A brief about the dataset…

I got a dataset from the SIPRI platform, which contains clean and trusted data about the transfer process between the supplier and recipient countries across the world from 1995 to 2025.
With some valuable fields such as
-	TIV (Trend Indicator Value): It is a measurement unit used by SIPRI to estimate the volume of international arms transfers, not their financial value
-	Weapon Status (new, second-hand but modernized_and_second-hand)
-	Year of order
-	Year of delivery

Added columns:
1-	Weapons Category contains 11 values
2-	SAMI Category: aggregation of the 11 standard categories to SAMI ones (Aerospace, Land, Sea, Advanced Electronics and Defense)  
3-	Continental
4-	Decade
5-	Orders Batches
